oh=00_AQQRIWkkXZ6UHIVNmNZo7rfDaGPe17SOwEi1EL14TI4RhQ&oe=6B09B41F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "1083730483394050", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86615253_1083730486727383_4084447030365624247_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3uyQ-UIEFasQ7kNvwHVCzIf&_nc_oc=AdqM_wKgc_CD6VjCIZFMcdQreq5yZGu9496nu5qKNtka9VuDAtgTkxd4N8wWrk_QhaU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRQ9-IRkBMeVkcoigIvuZVwNFrbrlbtcwTtGpI0G22Mbw&oe=6B09CCEB"}, "display_name": "Catastrophic Inversion", "keywords": ["Arena", "Laser", "Cyber", "Huge", "Neon"], "long_description": "Catastrophic Inversion is a VR laser-tag experience built for large spaces, like the gym at your school or community center.\nInstead of using a joystick or teleporting, you **walk naturally around the maps**, alongside the other players.\nWith two simple taps to calibrate, everyone is lined up and ready to go.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE:** in order to play in shared space on maps larger than 33' x 33'. you will need to have your headset in **Developer Mode** so you can temporarily disable the Guardian boundary.\nThis can be done in the **Headset Settings** on the **Meta Horizon** mobile app. You will need to create a meta developer account, but anyone can do this even if they aren't a developer.\n\n**Take on your friends** in several exciting locations in a **neon cyber world!**\n\n- One-time setup of a space takes only a few minutes.\n- If you don't have a large space, you can play in joystick mode.\n- Multiplayer is hosted locally and can be done without an internet connection. (LAN Wi-Fi connection still required.)\n\nCatastrophic Inversion is still in early access. There are some quality-of-life updates and much more content on the way, but currently the game offers:\n- Four Weapon Types (Including Powered Turrets)\n- Customizable Game Modes (CTF/Deathmatch/Elimination, timed/scored, teams/free-for-all)\n- Two 89' x 50' maps\n- One 79' x 46' map\n- One 33' x 33' map\n- One 10' x 10' demo platform for testing the Shared Space features at home.", "short_description": "Grab your friends, bring your headsets, and head to the biggest space you can find!\n\nCatastrophic Inversion is a cyber-themed shooter that allows you to turn any large space into an immersive multiplayer VR experience rivaling professional venues."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.toastidwaffel.com/policies", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.toastidwaffel.com/policies", "publisher_name": "Toastid Waffel", "support_website_url": "https://www.toastidwaffel.com/about-us", "website_url": "https://toastidwaffel.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "8474627532646895"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "661419730089252"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "934192472096557"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "661419730089252"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1774872240, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "661419730089252"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "29243138158702529", "version": "0.13.2.0.1"}, "id": "805854184929089",